\f[CR]server_winpipe_token_path\f[R](3)
.SH NOTES
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]Cygwin only\f[R]: Compiled only when \f[CR]__CYGWIN__\f[R] is
defined.
.IP \(bu 2
The helper thread pattern avoids \f[CR]FILE_FLAG_OVERLAPPED\f[R] on the
pipe HANDLE, which would break Cygwin\(cqs POSIX I/O layer after
\f[CR]cygwin_attach_handle_to_fd()\f[R].
.IP \(bu 2
The 500ms poll interval provides a balance between shutdown
responsiveness and CPU usage.
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]ERROR_PIPE_CONNECTED\f[R] from \f[CR]ConnectNamedPipe()\f[R] is
